[length:03:36]
[ti:I'm Nothing]
[ar:Aracne]
[al:Chaotic-Dysfunctional]
[au:Aracne]
[lr:Aracne]
[by:Aracne]
[re:LRC Workbench by Azaria (lrc-workbench.azariadev.dev)]
[ve:0.3.3]
[00:02.67]Yay!...
[00:04.69]focus… 
[00:07.11]loading…
[00:10.08]failed again…
[00:12.19]AGAIN!
[00:21.71]I had it mapped inside my head
[00:23.80]every step, every thread
[00:25.82]but the moment I begin
[00:27.21]everything just splits instead
[00:28.88]I see it clear, I feel it right
[00:30.45]I know the shape, I know the line
[00:32.11]but my hands don’t follow through
[00:33.73]like they’re not even mine
[00:35.55]I start fast, I burn out quick
[00:37.28]lose the grip, forget the script
[00:39.05]every “almost” cuts me deep
[00:40.62]every “try again” sticks
[00:42.13]don’t say “you’re smart” like it’s enough
[00:43.95]I’m drowning in unfinished stuff
[00:45.83]I’m not lazy, I’m just stuck
[00:47.47]inside a brain that self-destructs
[00:49.23]I’m not broken — I just don’t fit
[00:52.55]in the system you designed for it
[00:56.07]I see more, I feel too much
[00:59.38]but I can’t turn it into touch
[01:03.67]try again — try again — try again
[01:06.43]I’m not less — I just don’t move
[01:10.37]the way you measure what I do
[01:13.65]try again — try again — try again
[01:16.82]they move steady, they move clean
[01:18.17]build a life I’ve never seen
[01:19.92]I’m still stuck between the lines
[01:21.54]of what I am and what I mean
[01:23.25]I forget what I just said
[01:25.02]lose the thread inside my head
[01:26.59]every door I almost open
[01:28.04]closes softly instead
[01:30.04]I want structure, I want calm
[01:31.75]I want silence in my lungs
[01:33.42]but my thoughts don’t sit in rows
[01:35.05]they just scatter when they come
[01:44.09]Performance variance detected
[01:45.77]Execution path rejected
[01:47.47]Cognitive drift — expected
[01:49.17]Emotional load: excessive
[01:50.93]Talent present, output low
[01:52.60]Inconsistency will show
[01:54.27]Recommendation: adjust
[01:55.92]or be replaced by stable flow
[01:59.54]I AM TRYING
[02:03.15]can’t you see it —
[02:06.07]I am trying
[02:09.22]every second just to be it
[02:11.74]you call it wasted potential
[02:15.07]I call it fighting my head
[02:18.32]you only see what I don’t do
[02:21.81]not the war inside instead
[02:25.49]try again — try again — try again
[02:28.36]try again — try again — try again
[02:31.32]I’m not broken — I just don’t fit
[02:34.94]in the system you designed for it
[02:38.02]if I’m too much or not enough
[02:41.42]maybe your scale is just corrupt
[02:46.04]try again — try again — try again
[02:48.54]I’m not less — I just don’t prove
[02:51.84]my worth in ways that look like you
[02:55.45]if I fail in your machine—
[03:02.92]try again — try again — try again
[03:10.80]…does it mean I’m nothing?
[03:23.78]retry… retry… retry…
[03:32.62]Retry...
